<title>UK: IKB SETS 250 MLN MARK STEP-UP FIVE-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>IKB SETS 250 MLN MARK STEP-UP FIVE-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SGZ-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IKB</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN MARK  COUPON     *4.25     MATURITY    22.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    22.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    DUSS	DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	*IN YEAR ONE, 4.50 PCT IN YEAR TWO, 5.0 PCT IN YEAR</p>
<p>		 THREE, 5.375 PCT IN YEAR FOUR, AND 5.75 PCT IN YEAR</p>
<p>		 FIVE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
